  (label "RXD0" (at 325.12 185.42 270) (fields_autoplaced)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom))
    (uuid aac6377a-6a41-513c-a50f-eaf5504b5cf7)
  )
  (text "NOTES\n1. PCB 26 x 46 mm, 2 layers, 1.6 mm. Every SMD part on the top side; J2 (screw terminal) hand soldered.\n2. U1 at the top edge, antenna to the edge: no copper, tracks or vias on either layer under the antenna area.\n3. Pins = firmware defaults (main/Kconfig.projbuild): reed switch GPIO4, BOOT / factory reset GPIO9 (hold 6 s),\n   status LED GPIO5 active high (enable CONFIG_STATUS_LED_ENABLE), USB Serial/JTAG on GPIO26/27.\n4. Reed input: R7 10k pull-up at the terminal (about 0.3 mA wetting current), R8 1k + C7 100nF filter, D2 ESD.\n   The firmware also enables the GPIO4 internal pull-up and debounces in software.\n5. Flashing and logs over USB-C (USB Serial/JTAG). Download mode by hand: hold BOOT (GPIO9 low, GPIO8 pulled\n   high by R5) and press RESET. USB-C: CC1/CC2 5.1k each (5 V sink), PTC + TVS on VBUS, USBLC6 on D+/D-.\n6. VBAT (pin 15) is tied to 3V3 inside the module (datasheet v1.6): not connected here.\n7. Unused GPIO: IO0-IO3, IO10-IO14, IO22, IO25 (IO25 strapping, floating = default). H1/H2: M2 holes, PCB only." (at 264.16 236.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 03da9b67-0c7f-557c-b2c4-0d320f14f1b9)
  )

  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
